<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> | Gerência de Eventos</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #08111f, #0f172a 48%, #101827); color: #e2e8f0; min-height: 100vh; }
    .topbar { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.1); backdrop-filter: blur(20px); padding: 0 2rem; height: 64px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .topbar-inner { width: 100%; max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .logo { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e2e8f0; text-decoration: none; }
    .logo-icon { color: #60a5fa; }
    .main-content { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; }
    .hero { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; text-align: center; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 800; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
    .hero p { color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .card { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.78); border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.14); border-radius: 18px; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(2,6,23,0.35); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    .note { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.2); color: #cbd5e1; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.65; }
    .note:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .note-warning { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.25); color: #fcd34d; }
    .actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #0ea5e9); color: white; }
    .btn-secondary { background: transparent; color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.2); }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; color: #64748b; font-size: 0.75rem; }
  </style>
  <%- include('../partials/mobile-fixes') %>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="logo-icon">◆</span> Gerência de Eventos</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main-content">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Solicitação de Cadastro Enviada</h1>
      <p>Sus dados foram recebidos e estão em processo de análise.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="note">
        Após o envio, sua conta ficará em análise. O acesso ao sistema só será liberado depois da aprovação administrativa, quando você receber por e-mail um link de uso único para definir sua senha.
      </div>

      <div class="note note-warning">
        Verifique seu e-mail, inclusive a caixa de Lixo Eletrônico ou Spam.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Voltar ao início</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>&copy; <%= year %> LIGEM.Redes • <%= typeof appVersion !== 'undefined' ? appVersion : 'V0.1' %></footer>
</body>
</html>
